Answer: No, the Indian government or the BJP did not announce a policy conditioning free COVID-19 vaccines on voting records or political affiliation. The search result describes the government's plan to distribute vaccines free of cost to priority groups—such as healthcare workers, frontline workers, and the elderly—under a special immunization program, with no mention of such a condition.

